s, Little Italy, \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\". Past card: Sakura Garden with status badge \\\"Cancelled\\\" plus date, time, party size, location and applied coupon.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Rating inconsistent between list and details; list summary not updated by new review\", \"actual\": \"The Golden Fork: list card shows 4.8 (no review count) while detail page showed 4.5 (2) before my review and 4.3 (3) after. After submitting a 4-star review the detail rating/count updated (4.5→4.3, 2→3) but the list card still shows the static 4.8.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
